data:
One of the best Ace Combat games ever made!

PROS
+ Spectacular campaign with engaging characters and an exceptional story;
+ Amazing graphics;
+ The best gameplay in the series;
+ The multiplayer mode is also quite fun;
+ Varied missions.

CONS
- Performance can drop drastically during some missions. Upscaling is essential;
- Real-time cutscenes are even more demanding. Don't waste your time trying to run them all at 60 fps (it's not worth the effort).

I played the entire campaign at 4K and 60 fps at Ultra Settings using DLSS Ultra Performance.

"Why not DLSS Performance at 4K or DLSS Quality at 1440p?" - Because it was impossible to maintain 60 fps+ with these settings at Ultra (or even High, tbh). Like I said, some missions are quite demanding in performance.
